-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Oracle documentation
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Keyword, function, operator, type, pseudo-column and package lists
(`src/oracle/keywords.ts`) are compiled from the public Oracle Database SQL
Language Reference and PL/SQL Language Reference. These are factual language
elements.
